[{:db/id "q-115071/selection/04f9566070c5e39d622faed7487676d27debbd366c354177306f677d79163db8" :answer/id #uuid "09cca1bb-f762-5045-8305-f51f1b489567" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115071/selection/137a36f90864aa31b00b425e592ffdf9cc965c6ccb2a5be788024179b56c2623" :answer/id #uuid "0f3cb3fa-a00b-5559-9df7-e3d257d7f3f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-3,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115071/selection/d085cd40d2335875b79a0336321fbc1fa2555f86d95ef0acf29fd3e7533ba004" :answer/id #uuid "a6c36e05-1708-582f-a878-d0a4e38fad1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-3,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115071/selection/a51b1c174c0889647dd8ea33038643ccfbea11eb7d6ee99f0ffb0ab85b1f26a1" :answer/id #uuid "e44c5bed-36c2-5aeb-ae82-4ce6d542ff34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-9,9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115071/selection/74885effa1574ef818ee9041067adf8a8425c5bd2d91ef23cdc43cd3ef26cf83" :answer/id #uuid "ff4b53a2-743d-5247-9d7d-8d92f426660c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,-9)\\cup (9,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115071/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "114b31c4-b664-55e1-a686-036f75ea421d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115071/selection/a51b1c174c0889647dd8ea33038643ccfbea11eb7d6ee99f0ffb0ab85b1f26a1" :answer-field/choices ["q-115071/selection/04f9566070c5e39d622faed7487676d27debbd366c354177306f677d79163db8" "q-115071/selection/137a36f90864aa31b00b425e592ffdf9cc965c6ccb2a5be788024179b56c2623" "q-115071/selection/d085cd40d2335875b79a0336321fbc1fa2555f86d95ef0acf29fd3e7533ba004" "q-115071/selection/a51b1c174c0889647dd8ea33038643ccfbea11eb7d6ee99f0ffb0ab85b1f26a1" "q-115071/selection/74885effa1574ef818ee9041067adf8a8425c5bd2d91ef23cdc43cd3ef26cf83"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115071" :question/id #uuid "605dcaa7-65f4-5e39-9d2c-56489cda96f8" :question/math-academy-id "q-115071" :question/problem "Solve the inequality  ${x}^{2}<81$ using a graphical method." :question/worked-solution "Bringing all the terms to the left-hand side, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2} & <81 \\\\ {x}^{2}-81 & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we consider the corresponding parabola given by $\\,y={x}^{2}-81\\,$ and find its roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-81 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-{9}^{2} & =0 \\\\ (x-9)(x+9) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the roots are $x=\\pm 9.$ \n\nSolving the inequality ${x}^{2}-81<0$ is equivalent to finding the values of $x$ for which the parabola $y={x}^{2}-81$ is below the $x$-axis (where $y<0$).\n\nSince the leading coefficient of the quadratic expression is positive, the parabola opens upward. Therefore, the solution set lies between the roots (but it does not include them), as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965374/assets/cc6a957d86d1bc08dfcb7a8e855bb45b41c11c85516c4fed8a6b8c41c1aee6f2.png)\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x\\in (-9,9).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-115071/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3ec4ab1-ad6f-5c4e-9b80-a1329f2e8f63"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115071"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261/selection/10bae6ac41330a2499c6b52fde07c921169f5e41ba35b00fbbef9e055015e61a" :answer/id #uuid "9b66080e-8892-5a74-bc4d-82bfa8adc58d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in [5,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261/selection/e28384b6d9aac1c066a52f46da4ec39bac7443c6c9ab9a5c4f299919dda4ef53" :answer/id #uuid "b4cb5d1c-0e2d-51fe-a51f-252a4a189e6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in [-5,5]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261/selection/a445f6eb7d3c2fb0087ae2a38344670f5abc3e25d6cc1f5f9b23b18c70c6490b" :answer/id #uuid "60c1e6cf-bbbe-5743-bb50-6cbf6ca35e05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,-5]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261/selection/fe593ab14d70e02c45c3ef98c6643e478fae543cb1ba535f15e67b221b428a95" :answer/id #uuid "a10b6d42-23bf-5c2d-8fa4-5ff260868737" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,-5]\\cup [5,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261/selection/b9c165db55b859f1db354d2b36a4915e5c7fca8ffde636e616cbd0705ac7b693" :answer/id #uuid "a520ae6d-8ac1-58e5-88a6-079c5381d6b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,5]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "be2f31c8-9da8-59a4-931f-7aae047de53f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70261/selection/fe593ab14d70e02c45c3ef98c6643e478fae543cb1ba535f15e67b221b428a95" :answer-field/choices ["q-70261/selection/10bae6ac41330a2499c6b52fde07c921169f5e41ba35b00fbbef9e055015e61a" "q-70261/selection/e28384b6d9aac1c066a52f46da4ec39bac7443c6c9ab9a5c4f299919dda4ef53" "q-70261/selection/a445f6eb7d3c2fb0087ae2a38344670f5abc3e25d6cc1f5f9b23b18c70c6490b" "q-70261/selection/fe593ab14d70e02c45c3ef98c6643e478fae543cb1ba535f15e67b221b428a95" "q-70261/selection/b9c165db55b859f1db354d2b36a4915e5c7fca8ffde636e616cbd0705ac7b693"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70261" :question/id #uuid "3d89b451-9545-5819-adbe-c21aafa486b0" :question/math-academy-id "q-70261" :question/problem "Solve the inequality  ${x}^{2}\\ge 25$ using a graphical method." :question/worked-solution "Bringing all the terms to the left-hand side, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2} & \\ge 25 \\\\ {x}^{2}-25 & \\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we consider the corresponding parabola given by $\\,y={x}^{2}-25\\,$ and find its roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-25 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-{5}^{2} & =0 \\\\ (x-5)(x+5) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the roots are $x=\\pm 5.$ \n\nSolving the inequality ${x}^{2}-25\\ge 0$ is equivalent to finding the values of $x$ for which the parabola $y={x}^{2}-25$ is above or intersects the $x$-axis (where $y\\ge 0$).\n\nSince the leading coefficient of the quadratic expression is positive, the parabola opens upward. Therefore, the solution set lies outside the roots (including them), as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965374/assets/77c4caaa90dc3978ab6590885113a7e4ac0d155d3c2082166ab91c70603b0ea0.png)\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x\\in (-\\infty ,-5]\\cup [5,\\infty ).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-70261/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3ec4ab1-ad6f-5c4e-9b80-a1329f2e8f63"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70261"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70260/selection/29f43fbdf43b9e0ae9016681efed10bd563e3f20b2c37d205a1e54a5d4c7cd49" :answer/id #uuid "72bdd43e-accf-5470-a959-e7531649aaa3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-6,6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70260/selection/6928425dda1d2a119241b75cb59db236e53dc0976b435a49729f1c84ce2131bb" :answer/id #uuid "04a9dcf8-d644-5a88-bdf2-7fe1678aaa42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,-6)\\cup (6,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70260/selection/9201fe2084a7364a60bbcc9ae0ab8ef6963bbcc1e3a16c4f69cb1dfe7b865fb8" :answer/id #uuid "87f303fc-02a3-52d3-ae2a-cc920d6ebcba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-\\infty ,-6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70260/selection/48ec32fd94671fad961d4617133fc0cd93bc354a72e6a0bc8415f128fcbbb822" :answer/id #uuid "12f0d2d7-68c7-5100-aa32-baec9f3b01c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\in (-6,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70260/selection/957a55cc8008db4295903b5